    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Union-find</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Merge by shared key</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/accounts-merge/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 721</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Accounts Merge</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Two accounts are the same person exactly when they are linked by a chain of shared emails. Union-find over account indices (key: email -> first account that listed it) builds those groups in one pass; then collect each group's emails, sort, and put the name in front.</p>\n"
